   "lines": [
    "Spent the day pre-",
    "-paring for my Mun-",
    "-sungun trip; I shall",
    "go in a canoe, ~~with~~",
    "alone with Seawall.",
    "For provisions I",
    "take tea, pork and",
    "hardtack ^& some flour^; we have",
    "a shelter tent, two",
    "blankets & some cooking",
    "utensils; & one complete",
    "change of underclothing",
    "each. I take 50",
    "cartridges for the rifle",
    "and 100 for the shot-",
    "gun. I shall only",
    "use moccasins"
   ],
